607	    /**
608	     * Works out the late fee and late interest charged by the given day, at the late fee (in US
609	     * dollars) and annual rate (a percentage), from the payments (those not reversed count), and keeps
610	     * them as part of what is payable. The fee is charged once, on the day the invoice becomes overdue
611	     * ({@link #graceDays()} days after its due date), when something is still owed then; it earns no
612	     * interest, and a payment from then on pays it first. A sent invoice not
613	     * spread over instalments, with something still owed more than {@link #graceDays()} days after its
614	     * due date, earns interest from the end of its grace period ({@link #graceDays()} days after its due
615	     * date), compounded daily at rate / 360 (Actual/360): a balance B owing for
616	     * d days earns B x ((1 + rate / 100 / 360)^d - 1), rounded half up to the cent. Each payment after
617	     * the grace period ends a period; every period earns interest on what the invoice still owed during it
618	     * (earlier interest, the fee and retention left out), and a payment pays the fee, then the interest
619	     * earned so far, then the invoice. An invoice spread over instalments instead earns interest
620	     * instalment by instalment (see {@link #accrueInstalmentInterest}), and no late fee. On the day the
621	     * charges were waived (after the day's payments), the fee and interest still unpaid are written off
622	     * (kept as what was waived) and that day ends a period: interest starts again from it on what is
623	     * still owed, and no new fee is charged.
624	     */
625	    public void accrueLateInterest(List<Payment> payments, BigDecimal taxRate, BigDecimal annualRate,
626	            BigDecimal lateFeeUsd, LocalDate today) {
627	        this.lateInterest = BigDecimal.ZERO;
628	        this.lateFee = BigDecimal.ZERO;
629	        this.lateWaived = BigDecimal.ZERO;
630	        this.instalmentInterest = List.of();
631	        if (status == InvoiceStatus.SENT && !isCreditNote() && hasPlan()) {
632	            accrueInstalmentInterest(payments, taxRate, annualRate, today);
633	            return;
634	        }
